{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Kitty Cat Combat",
    "steam_appid": 2721320,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721320/extras/87fa5b18d15427c00ed62a9a1be80941.avif?t=1738748989\" width=640 height=206 /></span><br><br>Welcome to a world where fantasy meets modern warfare, a world where both beast and mankind dwell.<br><br>In the small kingdom of Estalberg, home to many a beast, infantry commander Musette is headed westward from the capital to conduct joint military drills when she receives news that a large-scale fire has broken out in a rural district along the kingdom's border.<br><br>Musette's mind flashes to the Fractaria Empire--an entity that has repeatedly invaded and expanded its might, as she leads her troops toward the western border to find out more...<br><br><strong>Game System and Features:</strong><br>\u30fbGun fire, bomb blasts, mages, dragons, and more in battles that fuse fantasy with modern warfare<br>\u30fbMusette and other quirky troop leaders (NPCs)<br>\u30fbMachine gun troops and other units that provide fire support to nearby units during battle<br>\u30fbDynamic battle system in which assaults are effective against deployments, deployments are effective against defense, and defense is effective against assaults<br>\u30fbRealtime battle scenes that'll have you glued to every moment<br>\u30fbSkill systems that troop leaders can leverage in battle<br>\u30fbEnemy weapons that you can plunder and use as your own<br>\u30fbImprove and develop weapons to hone your troops into an all-mighty infantry",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721320/extras/87fa5b18d15427c00ed62a9a1be80941.avif?t=1738748989\" width=640 height=206 /></span><br><br>Welcome to a world where fantasy meets modern warfare, a world where both beast and mankind dwell.<br><br>In the small kingdom of Estalberg, home to many a beast, infantry commander Musette is headed westward from the capital to conduct joint military drills when she receives news that a large-scale fire has broken out in a rural district along the kingdom's border.<br><br>Musette's mind flashes to the Fractaria Empire--an entity that has repeatedly invaded and expanded its might, as she leads her troops toward the western border to find out more...<br><br><strong>Game System and Features:</strong><br>\u30fbGun fire, bomb blasts, mages, dragons, and more in battles that fuse fantasy with modern warfare<br>\u30fbMusette and other quirky troop leaders (NPCs)<br>\u30fbMachine gun troops and other units that provide fire support to nearby units during battle<br>\u30fbDynamic battle system in which assaults are effective against deployments, deployments are effective against defense, and defense is effective against assaults<br>\u30fbRealtime battle scenes that'll have you glued to every moment<br>\u30fbSkill systems that troop leaders can leverage in battle<br>\u30fbEnemy weapons that you can plunder and use as your own<br>\u30fbImprove and develop weapons to hone your troops into an all-mighty infantry",
